  "metadata": {
    "template": "1899",
    "visual_intent": "Aged parchment. Warm off-white land, sepia/brown ink roads, muted blue-grey water, zero saturated color, serif-ish feel via Noto Sans Italic for labels.",
    "TODO": "Add paper fill-pattern texture on the background/land layer. Replace Noto Sans font stacks with western serif typography glyphs and custom antique engraved map symbols. Replace POI circle markers with custom woodcut / engraved sprite icons."
  },
